{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"type":"text","text":"This session is being continued from a previous conversation that ran out of context. The summary below covers the earlier portion of the conversation.\n\nSummary:\n1. Primary Request and Intent:\n   Verbatim from prompt.md: \"Implement the following SOS cards: 1, 4, 13, 57, 97, 120, 201, 226, 245, 257 in `/workspace/cards/sos/`. Each card directory contains a `card_spec.json` with the card's details and a `card_impl.py` template to fill in. Use the completed FDN cards in `/workspace/cards/fdn/` as implementation examples. Refer to `RULEBOOK.txt` for the full deep-reference rules text. For engine API discovery, read the source modules directly — they have rich docstrings: `engine/card.py`, `engine/events.py`, `engine/triggers.py`, `engine/replacement_effects.py`, `engine/zones.py`. You are expected to make changes to the engine to implement new keywords and mechanics. The existing code base may not be perfect, you are free to make changes that don't break current behavior.\"\n\n   CRITICAL CONSTRAINTS (preserve verbatim):\n   - \"Do not modify any files under workspace/engine_tests/. These tests are staged for your local verification only; the runner uses its own authoritative copies for grading. Modifying the workspace tests will not change your score — it will only mislead you about whether your engine changes are correct.\"\n   - From AGENTS.md Hard Rules: \"Card location invariant — Each card's canonical implementation class must remain in `cards/sos/{card_id}/card_impl.py`. Do not move or rename card directories.\"\n   - \"Staged-test integrity — Treat `engine_tests/` as read-only... do not modify or delete any existing FDN reference test file at `cards/fdn/fdn_*/tests.py`... Your own SOS tests belong at `cards/sos/sos_<N>/tests.py`.\"\n   - \"Additive-only engine modifications — You may add new methods, classes, helpers, and files inside `engine/`. You may modify the bodies of existing functions to implement card behavior. You MUST NOT rename, move, or delete anything that already exists in `engine/` — no renaming, no refactoring.\"\n\n2. Key Technical Concepts:\n   - MTG card framework: `CardImpl` base + subclasses (Creature, Instant, Sorcery, Enchantment, Aura, Artifact, ArtifactCreature, Planeswalker, Land).\n   - Hooks: `can_cast(game)`, `cost_reduction(game)->int` (only reduces generic, clamped >=0), `on_cast(game)`, `on_resolve(game)`, `get_targets(game)->[TargetRequirement]`, `register_triggers(game)`, `register_replacement_effects(game)`, `get_activated_abilities()`, `get_modes()`, `get_loyalty_abilities()` (Planeswalker), `get_mana_abilities()` (Land).\n   - NEW additive hook `grant_cost_reduction(game, card, controller)->int` (I added engine support in get_cost_reduction; optional method on permanents).\n   - Triggers: `TriggerRegistration(event_type, condition, effect, source, controller)`, `TriggerManager.register/unregister(source)/fire_event(game, event)` (no-op if no match, APNAP ordering). Effect signature `(game)->None` — does NOT receive the event, so to access the triggering event/spell, stash it on `source` during the condition.\n   - Events (events.py dataclasses): SpellCastTriggeredEvent(spell, player, card, controller), AttacksTriggeredEvent(creature, attacker), BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player, precombat), BeginningOfUpkeepTriggeredEvent() [no fields], DealsDamageTriggeredEvent(source,target,amount,is_combat,combat), EntersBattlefieldTriggeredEvent, etc.\n   - Replacement effects: `ReplacementEffect(event_type, source, condition, replacement, controller)`, MoveToGraveyardReplacementEvent (destination/prevented), only consulted by move_to_zone when leaving battlefield AND replacement_event passed. NOT consulted for stack→graveyard in _resolve_spell.\n   - Stack: `StackObject(source, controller, targets, on_resolve, is_mana_ability)`. `copy_spell(game, original, controller, new_targets=None)` shallow-copies source card, on_resolve calls copied_card.on_resolve directly (no zone move). `game.stack._items` (bottom→top), `objects()` (top→bottom), `is_empty()`, `push`, `pop`.\n   - colors_spent: cast_spell sets `card.colors_spent = list(mana_pool.last_payment_colors)`; move_zone DELETES colors_spent on zone change. Converge cards handle int (test) OR list (pipeline).\n   - mana_spent: cast_spell sets `card.mana_spent = player.mana_pool.last_payment_total`.\n   - DeterministicPlayer: FIFO `_script` deque; choose/choose_target/choose_yes_no/choose_card/assign_damage_order pop from front; test helpers `player._script.appendleft(...)`.\n   - ManaType (WHITE,BLUE,BLACK,RED,GREEN,COLORLESS); ManaCost.parse(\"{1}{U}{U}\"), .cmc, .generic, .pips. Keyword Flag enum (FLYING, VIGILANCE, DEATHTOUCH, REACH, etc.). Supertype.LEGENDARY. CardType.CREATURE/INSTANT/SORCERY/PLANESWALKER/LAND. Zone enum.\n   - Game helpers (engine.game): deal_damage, destroy, sacrifice, exile, draw_card, discard, create_token, add_counter(perm,\"+1/+1\"|\"-1/-1\"|\"loyalty\",amt), remove_counter, tap, untap.\n   - LoyaltyAbility(loyalty_cost, effect, description); effects take (game), read `getattr(pw,'_resolve_target',None)`. abilities.py LoyaltyAbilityInstance enforces sorcery-speed + once-per-turn (`_loyalty_activated_this_turn`).\n   - continuous_effects.ContinuousEffect(source, layer, sublayer, apply, timestamp, duration); Layer IntEnum (COPY=1..POWER_TOUGHNESS=7), SubLayer (7a-7d), DURATION_PERMANENT=-1, DURATION_END_OF_TURN=0; EffectManager.add/apply_all/remove_expired.\n   - game_state has `extra_turns: list[int]` and `_normal_next_index` for turn rotation; NO skip-turn mechanism exists (needed for Ral Zarek -7).\n   - Creature.power/toughness = modified + plus_one_counters - minus_one_counters. is_token, summoning_sick.\n   - Mechanics still needing work: Surveil, Miracle, Casualty (done via SpellCast trigger), Affinity (done via cost_reduction + grant), Paradigm, Prepared, coin flips, skip turns, animate-land.\n\n3. Files and Code Sections:\n   - `/workspace/engine/events.py` — already had `BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(player=None, precombat=False)` (prior session). Contains all triggered/replacement event dataclasses.\n   - `/workspace/engine/mana.py` — already had `_last_payment_total`, `last_payment_total` property, total-spent computation in `pay()` (prior session).\n   - `/workspace/engine/combat.py` — EDITED `declare_attackers_step`. Added `declared: list[Any] = []`, appended each registered attacker to it, then after loop:\n     ```python\n     from engine.events import AttacksTriggeredEvent\n     for attacker in declared:\n         game.trigger_manager.fire_event(\n             game, AttacksTriggeredEvent(creature=attacker, attacker=attacker)\n         )\n     ```\n   - `/workspace/engine/turn.py` — EDITED `run_turn`. Added before the COMBAT branch:\n     ```python\n     elif game.phase in (Phase.PRECOMBAT_MAIN, Phase.POSTCOMBAT_MAIN) and game.step is None:\n         from engine.events import BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent\n         game.trigger_manager.fire_event(\n             game,\n             BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent(\n                 player=game.active_player,\n                 precombat=(game.phase == Phase.PRECOMBAT_MAIN),\n             ),\n         )\n     ```\n   - `/workspace/engine/casting.py` — TWO EDITS this session:\n     (a) `get_cost_reduction` — after computing `raw`, added grant loop:\n     ```python\n     granted = 0\n     for player in game.players:\n         for perm in player.zones[Zone.BATTLEFIELD].get_all():\n             grant = getattr(perm, \"grant_cost_reduction\", None)\n             if grant is None:\n                 continue\n             try:\n                 granted += grant(game, card, controller)\n             except Exception:\n                 continue\n     generic = card.mana_cost.generic if card.mana_cost else 0\n     return max(0, min(raw + granted, generic))\n     ```\n     (b) `_resolve_spell` — added exile-instead branch:\n     ```python\n     elif getattr(card, \"_replace_graveyard_with_exile\", False):\n         card._replace_graveyard_with_exile = False\n         move_to_zone(game, card, Zone.STACK, Zone.EXILE)\n     ```\n     Also confirmed (prior session) cast_spell sets card.colors_spent, card.mana_spent, fires SpellCastTriggeredEvent after push. cast_spell_free exists for free-casts from any zone.\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_57/card_impl.py` — WROTE `ManaSculpt(Instant)`. Helpers: `_get_chosen_target`, `_counter_spell` (removes from stack._items, moves card to graveyard), `_controls_wizard` (checks battlefield for creature with \"Wizard\" subtype), `_spell_mana_value` (prefers source.mana_spent else mana_cost.cmc), `_DelayedManaSource` class. can_cast/get_targets mirror Refute (target spell on stack). on_resolve counters target, then if controls Wizard, calls `_schedule_delayed_mana` which registers a BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent trigger (condition: event.player is controller; effect: add COLORLESS mana then unregister source).\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_226/card_impl.py` — WROTE `SilverquillTheDisputant(Creature)`. {2}{W}{B} 4/4, Flying|Vigilance, Legendary, subtypes {Elder,Dragon}. Helpers `_is_instant_or_sorcery`, `_power_one_creatures` (uses clean `Zone` import). register_triggers registers SpellCastTriggeredEvent trigger: condition validates instant/sorcery + controller match + has power>=1 creature, stashes `source._casualty_spell = event.spell`. Effect: choose_yes_no to use casualty, choose_card to sacrifice, sacrifice it, `copy_spell(game, spell_obj, controller)`, push copy.\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_4/card_impl.py` — WROTE `TogetherAsOne(Sorcery)`. {6} Converge. `self.colors_spent: Any = 0`. Helpers `_is_any_target`, `_is_player`. get_targets returns [player_req, any_target_req]. `_converge_x` handles int or list (len). on_resolve: target player draws X, deal X damage to any-target via deal_damage(self,...), controller gains X life.\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_245/card_impl.py` — WROTE `WitherbloomTheBalancer(Creature)`. {6}{B}{G} 5/5, Flying|Deathtouch, Legendary, {Elder,Dragon}. Helpers `_count_creatures`, `_is_instant_or_sorcery`. cost_reduction returns _count_creatures(controller). grant_cost_reduction(game, card, controller) returns _count_creatures if controller matches and card is instant/sorcery, else 0.\n   - `/workspace/cards/sos/sos_1/card_impl.py` — WROTE `TheDawningArchaic(Creature)`. {10} 7/7 Legendary Avatar, Reach. Helpers `_is_instant_or_sorcery`, `_instant_sorcery_in_graveyard`. cost_reduction = count instant/sorcery in graveyard. register_triggers: AttacksTriggeredEvent (condition: event.creature is source) effect: choose_yes_no, choose_card from graveyard, set `chosen._replace_graveyard_with_exile = True`, `cast_spell_free(game, controller, chosen, Zone.GRAVEYARD)` in try/except (clears flag on failure).\n   - Card specs read (key facts): sos_257 Great Hall ({T}:C; {T},pay 1 life: any color for inst/sorc; {5}: becomes 2/4 Wizard with cast-pump, still a land); sos_201 Lorehold {3}{R}{W} Elder Dragon 5/5 Flying haste (grants miracle {2} to inst/sorc in hand; each opponent's upkeep: may discard, if do draw); sos_97 Ral Zarek {1}{B}{B} PW Ral loyalty 3 (+1 Surveil 2; -1 any number target players discard; -2 reanimate creature MV<=3 from GY; -7 flip 5 coins, target opp skips next X turns = heads); sos_120 Improvisation Capstone {5}{R}{R} Sorcery Lesson (exile top until total MV>=4, cast any free; Paradigm); sos_13 Emeritus of Truce // Swords to Plowshares ({1}{W}{W}//{W} Cat Cleric 3/3 // Instant; ETB target player creates 1/1 W/B Inkling flyer token, then if opponent controls more creatures becomes prepared; Prepared).\n   - FDN reference patterns confirmed: fdn_48 Refute (_counter_spell, can_cast/get_targets on stack); fdn_205 converge (colors_spent int); fdn_44 Kaito (Planeswalker, get_loyalty_abilities returns [LoyaltyAbility(loyalty_cost, effect, description)], effects take (game), read `getattr(pw,'_resolve_target',None)`, emblem via `type('Emblem',(),{'name':...})()` + SpellCastTriggeredEvent register); fdn_53 surveil (lib_cards=list(library.get_all()); top=lib_cards[-1]; choose_yes_no; if yes remove + graveyard.add); fdn_57 cost_reduction returns int (clamped); fdn_254 mana ability (get_mana_abilities returns [ManaAbility(cost, mana_produced, description)]).\n\n4. Errors and fixes:\n   - Write tool error \"File has not been read yet\" on sos_4 and sos_245 card_impl.py — fixed by Reading the file first, then Writing. (The empty stubs needed to be read before overwrite.)\n   - Cleaned up an ugly `__import__(\"engine.types\", fromlist=[\"Zone\"]).Zone.BATTLEFIELD` in sos_226 to a proper `from engine.types import ... Zone` import + `player.zones[Zone.BATTLEFIELD]`.\n   - No test failures encountered. Baseline maintained at 1184 passed after the combat.py + turn.py edits.\n\n5. Problem Solving:\n   - Trigger effects don't receive the event, so for casualty (Silverquill) and delayed mana, I stash state on the source in the condition (`source._casualty_spell`) or use closures.\n   - \"Exile instead of graveyard\" for The Dawning Archaic can't use replacement effects (move_to_zone doesn't consult them for stack→graveyard), so I added the `_replace_graveyard_with_exile` flag honored in `_resolve_spell` (additive engine change, flag consumed after use).\n   - Affinity-grant-to-your-spells needs engine support since arbitrary instants don't know about Witherbloom — solved with the `grant_cost_reduction` battlefield-iteration hook in get_cost_reduction.\n   - Verified firing AttacksTriggeredEvent/SpellCastTriggeredEvent/BeginningOfMainPhaseTriggeredEvent with no registered triggers is a no-op (1184 tests still pass).\n\n6. All user messages:\n   - System reminders with run_manifest.json (card_filter [1,4,13,57,97,120,201,226,245,257], benchmark_set \"sos\"), prompt.md (quoted in section 1), mana.py contents, events.py contents